      "created_at": "2026-01-21T12:34:10.698Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello,</p>\n<p>We would like to make the print format more compact. How can I reduce the line spacing between fields (red) in the print format?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/6/3658fa8f6999768256c2e61fd8a277521bfbfb7e.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/3658fa8f6999768256c2e61fd8a277521bfbfb7e\" title=\"ERP-Next_Space\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/6/3658fa8f6999768256c2e61fd8a277521bfbfb7e.png\" alt=\"ERP-Next_Space\" data-base62-sha1=\"7KMq0ygNjfPfHxillI7VDcmqhsy\" width=\"690\" height=\"485\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">ERP-Next_Space</span><span class=\"informations\">690×485 10.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Best regards,</p>\n<p>Patrick</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/c6cbf5/{size}.png",
