      "id": 492113,
      "username": "indianyogeshdaga",
      "name": "Yogesh Daga",
      "created_at": "2026-01-21T22:37:38.892Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Add this to your Print Format → CSS:</p>\n<p>.print-format,<br>\n.print-format * {<br>\nline-height: 1.2;<br>\n}</p>\n<p>You can go tighter if needed:</p>\n<p>line-height: 1.1;</p>\n<p>Avoid going below 1.05 (text becomes unreadable in PDF).</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/indianyogeshdaga/{size}/93373_2.png",
